  "description": "What the design is: A digital collection of 20 high-resolution PNG illustrations featuring festive watercolor Christmas elements, gingerbread houses, pine wreaths, wrapped gifts, and holiday trees.\nIncluded file formats: High-resolution PNG files (300 DPI) with transparent backgrounds, optimized for digital crafting, professional printing, and cutting machines.\nPotential use cases:\nPhysical crafting and scrapbooking using Cricut and Silhouette cutting machines.\nSublimation printing for custom mugs, tumblers, coasters, and holiday homeware blanks.\nPrint-on-demand (POD) merchandise and commercial physical holiday items.\nCustom apparel creation for Christmas t-shirts, festive hoodies, aprons, and seasonal tote bags.\nChristmas, holiday, winter, and seasonal celebration-themed wall art, greeting cards, party invitations, and custom stickers.",
